      "created_at": "2016-12-24T19:34:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>But the game text of the card says:</p>\n<p>Put the top card of the villain deck into play.<br>\nThen put the top card of each hero deck into play in turn order.  If a limited card already in play would be put into play, discard that card instead.</p>\n<p>So the only way that interpretation makes sense is if the first villain’s deck is considered the villain deck and all other villain decks are considered Hero decks for some reason.</p>",
