      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e5b9ba/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-01-04T17:01:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The additional rules for Villain Team Mode in the iOS port say \"If a card affects 'the Villain deck,' the players may pick any one of the Villain decks in play.\" &nbsp;It would seem that by the RAW, the official interpretation is wrong. &nbsp;That being a non-starter, either the rules or the cards need rewriting. &nbsp;</p>",
